caption: Default Mastery shape
engine-rule: default-mastery-shape

Ritual Mastery has no minimum character-point investment requirement.

The shared Domain governing skill at 20+.

Several spell penalties substantially or fully bought off.

For broad Ritual Traditions using the standard vanilla spell corpus, all 27 vanilla GURPS Magic College skills at 16+; narrower Ritual Traditions should require every College skill in their legal scope or an explicitly equivalent breadth benchmark. This requirement is intended to establish broad ritual competence rather than impose a major point sink; mature Ritual practitioners are normally expected to have enough IQ and Magery that many College skills require only minimal point investment.

A major working, grimoire, order, or other defining use.
